meta {
  name: Browse barbershops
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_api_url}}/v1/companies?languageCode=el
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  languageCode: el
  ~search: κουρειο
  ~date: 2026-09-09
  ~from: 09:00
  ~to: 12:00
  ~serviceIds: 
  ~categoryIds: 
  ~latitude: 37.97157785594371
  ~longitude: 23.725726869039587
  ~businessTypeCode: barbershop
}

docs {
  Anonymous — no token. Every parameter is optional; the disabled ones above are the
  filters, left off so the default call returns the whole list.

  search       folded to ignore case and accents, matched against every translated name
  date         local date at the company
  from / to    local time range, either one usable without a date
  serviceIds   a service belongs to one company, so this narrows to that company
  categoryIds  the cross-shop filter — platform categories are the shared ones
  latitude
  longitude    both or neither; the configured origin fills in when absent

  Unpaged and uncapped: every match comes back, ordered by distance.
}
